WEBVTT

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:04.280
While he was kidnapped,

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:08.790
maybe he went through something he doesn't want to tell anyone.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.060
If that's the case...

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.520
Precious boy.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:26.740
My...

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:28.730
My...

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.640
Mom!

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:48.610
Keiichirou!

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:50.070
Mom!

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:52.060
Keiichirou!

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:53.770
You held up well.

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:56.700
You're a good boy, Keiichirou!

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:01.870
Mom! Mom!

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:03.080
What's wrong?

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:05.820
There was a man.

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:10.750
He made me eat nothing but cake every day.

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:50.010
So as I said yesterday,

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:54.750
starting today, these cops will be using Eiji's room upstairs for a stakeout.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:56.340
My name is Udagawa.

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:57.070
I'm Yoshioka.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:02.390
How about it? Are they your type, Ono?

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:04.830
No, I'm fine. What about you?

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:06.870
Me?

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:07.700
I'm all right.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:12.210
Detective, this is our chef pâtissier, Ono.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.320
Hello.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:15.520
This is my assistant, Kanda-kun.

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:16.030
Hello.

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:19.790
We're really grateful for your cooperation with our investigation.

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:23.180
We'll try to be careful and not interrupt your business.

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:25.510
Right...

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:30.600
Well, let's go back to work.

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:31.270
Okay.

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:36.090
Hey, what's wrong?

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:40.790
Umm, nothing. It's just that I still have the urge to run when I see cops.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.240
Idiot. Get to work!

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:47.700
I'm the salesman, Kobayakawa.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.700
Oh. N-Nice to meet you.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:52.350
Oh, there's a camera inside there?

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:53.830
It's really small.

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:55.030
Yes.

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:58.630
Technology nowadays is just great.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:01.110
By the way, where do you want the other camera?

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:04.540
Oh, I'd like to put it under the eaves, if possible.

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:05.910
Then, this way.

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:11.140
But you sure look sharp.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:15.270
Do women like it if you sell cakes while wearing sunglasses?

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:16.550
Oh, no.

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:18.940
My eyes are a bit weak.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:24.350
Even wearing these, I think my eyes are getting worse.

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:28.870
They might just continue to deteriorate.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:35.200
Well, stay healthy.

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:40.520
A man like you, who's not suited to selling cakes, must have a strong reason to work here.

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:46.010
Will this angle do?

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:48.440
I suppose so.

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:51.430
Then I'll go upstairs and check it.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:02.110
It's working.

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:06.600
Well then, owner, if something comes up, please send a message to my cell phone.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:07.490
Yes.

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:13.930
Okay, let's open.

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:19.460
Good afternoon.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.710
Business is good today, too, isn't it?

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:25.170
All because of your patronage. Thank you very much.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:28.640
Hey, hey, what do you recommend for a chocolate cake?

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:33.130
Then, how about this slightly spicy Kitano?

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:41.270
An elegant cake of pepper-flavored brûlée wrapped in smooth chocolate mousse and ganache.

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:43.330
It's really delicious.

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:45.640
Oh, then I'll try it.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.240
Certainly.

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:52.500
We seem to go to the gym just so we can have cake here.

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:55.890
Yes. It's like our husbands and their beer.

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:57.210
Please make yourself at home.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:00.950
Could you put "Happy Birthday Dad" on it?

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:03.170
Certainly.

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:06.050
Nevertheless, this shop is popular.

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:09.090
Yeah. I suppose the cakes are very tasty.

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:16.230
Udagawa-san, how goes it?

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:19.600
Did you see anyone suspicious?

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:23.080
Well...

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:28.180
The cakes look really tasty!

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:31.700
Hey, hey, watch the customers, not the cakes!

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:33.530
Many thanks for your trouble.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:36.410
If you like sweets...

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:38.780
I really like them.

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.040
Udagawa-san!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.890
Sorry, he's diabetic.

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:45.870
Then how about this?

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:48.070
Tofu scraps with plenty of chopped scallions.

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:49.690
Meat-filled green bell peppers.

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:51.970
Eggplant pickled in rice bran, and plain rice balls.

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:56.780
That sounds wonderful.

00:06:56.780 --> 00:07:01.710
Actually I wanted to eat this too, but I couldn't make just one portion.

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:04.610
That's mean, Yoshioka. Only you get to eat.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:06.280
Okay, I understand.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:09.590
Udagawa-san, you can eat your sweets.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:17.370
Well, if the kidnapper appears soon,
this won't be a tough assignment at all.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:22.070
By the way, owner, has a strange customer or something like that come in?

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:24.240
No.

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:30.970
And I doubt if Kobayakawa could judge whether a customer was suspicious or not.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.420
It's probably a male.

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:37.220
Neither a kid nor an old man.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:43.060
I'm not a professional profiler, so that's as far as I can go.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:51.870
What's up, Udagawa-san?

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:54.110
Isn't he suspicious?

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:57.050
He's really acting suspiciously.

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:05.980
No.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:09.710
He's a regular patron, part of a couple.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.300
I vouch for his identity.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:15.340
Oh! This one's suspicious too.

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:19.760
You got any beer in this joint?

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.100
Beer, I said. Beer!

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:30.180
I'm sorry, sir.

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:33.700
Unfortunately, we do not sell beer.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:35.570
You don't have it?

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:36.960
Then what'd'ya got?

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:38.940
What about this man?

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.880
I think he's just a drunk who's in the wrong place.

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:45.120
I've never seen him before.

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:47.360
Let's watch how things go for a bit longer.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.940
Have you made up your mind, sir?

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:51.750
Then coffee and...

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:54.800
Cake, don't you have something like that?

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.790
Then, how about a Choux à la crème?

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:01.680
I'll try it.

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:06.380
Thank you for waiting.

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:14.440
I wonder if Chikage-san will be all right.

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:17.160
If needed, I'll chuck that guy out.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.350
D-Do you need something, sir?

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:26.360
Don't run, moron!

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:28.790
My contact. I've lost a contact lens!

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:31.430
I dropped it somewhere in here.

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:33.350
What're you gonna do, huh?

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:33.910
Huh?!

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:34.880
W-Well...

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:38.270
What's up with this guy?

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:40.180
He's a jerk.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:42.520
I have to go now.

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:43.810
Sir.

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:47.420
Wh-What? You gonna pick a fight?

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:04.540
I'll search for it immediately, so please wait a moment.

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:06.370
Chikage...

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:26.560
Excuse me. Could you move your legs, please?

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:11.890
I'm sorry. I couldn't find it.

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:13.510
It's all right.

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:15.900
How much?

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:17.860
Keep the change.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:20.070
But...

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:23.490
The cake was tasty.

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:24.490
Thanks.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:29.390
Thank you very much.

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:35.270
Did you see that?

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:36.440
Right!

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:38.340
Owner, that moved me.

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:41.790
To be honest, I thought this shop was kind of shady, but it's great!

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:45.760
Yeah. That kind of worker must be invaluable, right?

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:48.500
Umm... Well... Uh...

00:11:51.590 --> 00:11:52.640
Time to close up.

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:55.590
Is it that time already?

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:56.440
Yes.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:58.820
Thanks for your kindness.

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:00.030
No problem.

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:08.070
Come on.

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:10.450
That's the reason I...

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:32.310
Tachibana, I left the rest to Kanda-kun, so I'll be going now.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.880
Oh, good work.

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:40.740
Are you all right?

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:43.610
What?

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.090
Nothing. Good work.

00:12:52.340 --> 00:12:53.120
Hey.

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:56.120
Doesn't Ono seem sexy somehow?

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.290
Huh?

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:01.050
Well, sometimes he makes my heart race.

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:05.370
What are you talking about?

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:07.070
Don't you understand?

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:09.630
He has that kind of aura.

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:10.900
I totally understand.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:11.980
That's true.

00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:14.350
If you look closely, his skin is beautiful.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.690
He's got big, dark eyes,

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:16.900
and thin wrists.

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:19.310
What are you guys talking about?

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:25.570
Well, if I had to decide between making it with an ugly woman or Ono,

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:27.330
I'd definitely take Ono.

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.280
Me too, maybe.

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:33.170
Don't talk like that.

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:36.410
That's rude to Ono.

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:40.210
If a guy saw me like that, it would creep me out.

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:53.830
Precious boy.

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:55.600
My...

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:57.480
My...

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.730
Umm, are you closed already?

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:19.910
No, it's all right.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:22.010
You're late today.

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:24.550
Huh? Yeah.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:27.050
You look tired.

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:30.130
Yes, perhaps a bit.

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:33.000
Sweets are just the thing when you feel like that.

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:34.820
Oh, yeah,

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:37.390
did you like the cake you bought last time?

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:41.350
Yes. It's always delicious.

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:46.020
Some of our cakes are already sold out, but please take a look, if you'd like.

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:48.700
Thank you.

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:03.080
Then may I have three Tobias?

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.760
Certainly.

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:11.710
So she's the last customer.

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:14.480
Well, not bad for the first day.

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:18.080
Thank you for waiting, madam.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.730
Thank you very much.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:25.300
Is anything wrong, madam?

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:27.570
No, it's nothing.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.070
I'm sorry.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.060
It's all right.

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:35.750
We still have more of those cakes.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.320
I'll bring some new ones.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:40.660
I'm really sorry.

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:45.670
Would you like to rest a while?

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.420
No, I'm fine.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:48.550
Absolutely fine.

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:52.930
Then, may I take you home in my car?

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:55.390
I'm fine. I live nearby.

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:58.560
I don't mind. We're closing.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:02.390
And we deliver cakes too, so don't worry about it.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.110
What's going on?

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:08.730
It seems like he's going to take that woman in his car.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:11.740
Yeah...

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:27.360
Really, really, here is fine.

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:28.490
Thank you.

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:31.500
No problem, and thank you for your patronage.

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:34.640
Please take care of yourself.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:35.360
Yes.

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:39.750
See you later.

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:15.560
Is that your child?

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:19.390
Yes, th-th-that's my child.

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:26.750
No! Don't go in with your shoes on.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:28.400
What are you doing? Hey!

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:29.640
Wait a second!

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:31.580
Wait!

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:34.040
Really, stop. Hey!

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:35.700
Hey! Wait!

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.940
Wait a moment! Hey.

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:46.060
Hold on! Hey!

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:49.680
Stop it. Stop!

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:50.630
I'll call the police.

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:54.090
Please do so.

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:00.410
Stop it.

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:02.600
I'm begging you.

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:08.850
While he was kidnapped,

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:14.070
maybe he went through something he doesn't want to tell anyone.

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:17.320
If that's the case...

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:24.310
Precious boy.

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:25.410
My...

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.290
My...

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:31.870
Keiichirou, you held up well.

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:34.750
You're a good boy, Keiichirou.

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:40.120
There was a man.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:44.600
He made me eat nothing but cake every day.

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:55.590
No! Don't go upstairs!

00:18:55.590 --> 00:18:56.800
Please, stop!

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:58.890
It really is my child!

00:18:58.890 --> 00:19:00.320
It is!

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:02.010
Hey, please!

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:05.930
Wait, please!

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:08.560
Hey! I'm begging, please wait!

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:09.270
Hey!

00:19:11.860 --> 00:19:13.750
Stop it, please!

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.710
Stop it!

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:31.390
No!

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:32.950
Open up.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:45.320
I said open up.

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:46.890
It's over.

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.610
The police will be here soon.

00:19:48.610 --> 00:19:50.650
I won't let you go anywhere.

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:52.290
Open the door.

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:57.210
If a guy saw me like that, it would creep me out.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:00.210
I love you.

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:07.930
Open the door.

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:10.500
At least, tell me why,

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:13.230
if you're not going to pay me back.

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:14.850
It makes me want to puke!

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:15.520
Die, homo!

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:17.990
I really...

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:21.340
didn't want to say that to him.

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:22.980
Yes.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:24.860
I...

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:26.120
Open the door.

00:20:35.190 --> 00:20:36.210
Help me...

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:42.360
It's all right.

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:47.160
I...

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:51.770
I... was just playing with him a bit.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:53.770
Come here.

00:20:57.930 --> 00:20:59.070
I got it.

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:04.700
Don't browbeat Mom.

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:26.610
The kidnapper was...

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:29.170
just a young man of 24.
